    "body": "Redrawing the statusline with :redrawstatus causes visible flicker when text changes are made rapidly (e.g. writing in Insert mode) and when the `delay.text_change` config option is set to a low value (e.g. 100). Instead, we can redraw the statusline at the same time that we redraw the buffer with nvim__redraw.\r\n\r\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n",
